# Cacaroon's trade kinds against Knight of Gold's (TOAU 4): at mission status 2 its Cacaroon trade handler answers
# exactly 1000 gil or one Imperial Bronze Piece with the Progress 3022, which ties Two Horn's 595 (exactly 1000 gil) and
# Rat Race's 850 (the bronze piece): they rotate; an Event kind loses to 3022 every time. A level 75 Warrior in
# Whitegate, Knight of Gold current at status 2 (GMs, reset after each trade: 3022's finish takes the trade and sets
# status 3). Two Horn accepted at Prog 0: four trades of exactly 1000 gil. Rat Race accepted at Prog 2: four trades
# of one bronze piece.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Cacaroon/onTrade AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/595 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/850
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=-70.5,0,-82.337 job=WAR lvl=75 gil=9000
item ImperialBronzePiece
mission Toau KnightOfGold current
quest AhtUrhgan.TwoHornTheSavage accepted
charvar Quest[6][17]Prog 0
login
missionstatus Toau 2
trade Cacaroon gil=1000                 # Two Horn Prog 0, status 2: 595 and 3022 tie
finish
missionstatus Toau 2
